HEALTHCARE DATA DISCLAIMER

This software is provided as a tool to assist healthcare organizations with
analytics infrastructure. Users are solely responsible for:

1. Ensuring compliance with HIPAA, HITECH, and all applicable healthcare
   regulations in their jurisdiction.

2. Properly securing Protected Health Information (PHI) and implementing
   appropriate access controls.

3. Conducting security assessments and obtaining necessary certifications
   before processing real patient data.

4. Validating all analytics outputs before using them for clinical or
   operational decision-making.

The authors and contributors of this software make no warranties regarding
its suitability for processing PHI or compliance with healthcare regulations.
This software should be reviewed by qualified security and compliance
professionals before deployment in production healthcare environments.
